    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在鼓勵學生自主修習數位平台上有關社會事業與永續經營管理之線上課程，培育相關理論知識的理解及應用，學生掌握永續管理的核心知識與技能，並能應用於社會創新與地方發展的實踐行動。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to encourage students to independently take online courses related to social enterprises and sustainable management through digital platforms. It fosters an understanding and application of relevant theoretical knowledge. Students will master the core knowledge and skills of sustainable management and apply them to practical actions in social innovation and local development.",
